(7538295, 1205115, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very interesting piece.  I really appreciate the coloring that gives the view a feel of being in a tent or out in the street with that yellow green street light feel.  The timing of the photo is good. It is so hard to capture sports in action to truly give the viewer a piece of what has occurred.  The reach from the left side of the frame really guides the eye.  I would be curious to see the photo with just a little tighter crop on the right side, I dont know if that would have improved the score or not.  Free study challenges are extremely hard and you did a great job! <br/></td>', 'Very interesting piece.  I really appreciate the coloring that gives the view a feel of being in a tent or out in the street with that yellow green street light feel.  The timing of the photo is good. It is so hard to capture sports in action to truly give the viewer a piece of what has occurred.  The reach from the left side of the frame really guides the eye.  I would be curious to see the photo with just a little tighter crop on the right side, I dont know if that would have improved the score or not.  Free study challenges are extremely hard and you did a great job! ', '2017-10-07 14:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
